<subpara id="RM000002CVW008X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002CVW008X_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00002VS00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness or Connector (Engine Control Computer - Air Fuel Ratio Sensor)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For wire harness inspection procedures and precautions, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the engine control computer and the air fuel ratio sensor connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the engine control computer and the air fuel ratio sensor vehicle side connector. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="X39400000QV016D"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A127715J07" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.21in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Name)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A112(A1A+) - 3(A1A+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A113(A1A-) - 4(A1A-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
