</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect connector A of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002CVW008X_04_0005" fin="false">NEXT</down>
